---
description: Prefer info icons over inline verbose help text in kafbat-webui
globs:
  - "**/*.vue"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Help text → info icon

- Put long explanations in **`AppInfoHint`** (tooltip/popover), not inline paragraphs.
- Form fields: **`AppFormLabel`** with `hint="..."` (never long text in the default slot).
- Section headers: **`AppSectionTitle`** with `hint="..."`.
- Page headers: **`AppPageHeader`** `description` (renders as info icon).
- Callout strips: **`AppContextHint`** — short `label` + `hint` (full text in icon).
- Keep validation errors and dynamic API messages as visible text (not hidden in icons).
